{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51490","headline":"骊山怀古（五首） 二 · 李郢","name":"骊山怀古（五首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟深树老蔽苍苍，楼殿参差隐夕阳。\n白玉砌寒苔自碧，真珠帘断月无光。\n骊山南去侵天尽，渭水东流入海长。\n唯有春风旧情在，不将花艳出宫墙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}